Summary/About Section (Tailor this to your specific experiences):

"Highly motivated and customer-centric IT professional with a proven track record in providing comprehensive support for Windows 10, Microsoft O365 applications, and hardware/software troubleshooting. Experienced in delivering exceptional concierge (VIP) support, ensuring seamless technology experiences for high-profile users. Proficient in SCCM client installation and troubleshooting, basic networking and Active Directory management, and meeting room/conference device support. Adept at documenting support activities within IT incident management systems (preferably ServiceNow). Possesses strong communication skills, a proactive attitude, and a commitment to resolving technical issues efficiently and effectively. Eager to leverage my expertise to contribute to a dynamic and customer-focused IT environment."

Key Points to Emphasize in Your Summary:

Concierge/VIP Support: Highlight your experience with high-profile users. Use terms like "white-glove service," "premium support," or "personalized assistance."
Customer-Centric Approach: Stress your dedication to providing excellent customer service.
Technical Skills: Clearly list your proficiency in Windows 10, O365, hardware/software troubleshooting, SCCM, networking, and Active Directory.
Documentation: Mention your experience with IT incident management systems, especially ServiceNow (if applicable).
Communication: Emphasize your ability to communicate effectively in various formats (phone, email, face-to-face).
Proactive Attitude: Showcase your ability to anticipate and resolve issues before they impact users.
Travel readiness if that is something you are open to.
